        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer: </strong>Purchase of this base game includes the first chapter. Further chapters will be coming soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Roach Hotel is an analog horror game set inside a once beloved hotel, a paradise for guest to come stay and relax. Step into its halls brought to life with a retro PS1 inspired aesthetic and unsettling VHS style visuals.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE HOTEL STORY:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Oxley Hotel, a resort that promises comfort to every guest. But behind its doors, the walls move when you’re not watching, and something stalks you in the shadows. Guided only by a note from your missing sister, you must uncover the truth, survive the lurking hallways, and escape the roaches crawling beneath the hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for your sister and uncover the  secrets buried beneath the Oxley Hotel. Discover what truly began this nightmare, but only if you step inside. Are you brave enough?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARRIVAL IN THE HOTEL:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE:</strong> Wander the  halls and uncover the unsettling secrets lurking within the hotel’s walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075080/extras/10c3ba65a2ae9463f7e07b5f81931556.poster.avif?t=1788357327\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075080/extras/10c3ba65a2ae9463f7e07b5f81931556.webm?t=1788357327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075080/extras/10c3ba65a2ae9463f7e07b5f81931556.mp4?t=1788357327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal the hidden truths buried within the hotel’s halls and discover behind the chaos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLASHLIGHT</strong>: Use your trusted flash light to see in the dark halls of the hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075080/extras/25e445c497a42702bfa4ea034236c058.poster.avif?t=1788357327\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075080/extras/25e445c497a42702bfa4ea034236c058.webm?t=1788357327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075080/extras/25e445c497a42702bfa4ea034236c058.mp4?t=1788357327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful in the dark, there might be roaches under your feet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HAMMER</strong>: This can come in handle to break things.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075080/extras/1ba0f281232e4bb9c4cd24f087264bd0.poster.avif?t=1788357327\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075080/extras/1ba0f281232e4bb9c4cd24f087264bd0.webm?t=1788357327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075080/extras/1ba0f281232e4bb9c4cd24f087264bd0.mp4?t=1788357327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Could also be useful to squish those big roaches.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GRAVITYPAL</strong>: Use this tool to move heavier objects to solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075080/extras/f8aa232b484dca48b6f6f02298a1045e.poster.avif?t=1788357327\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075080/extras/f8aa232b484dca48b6f6f02298a1045e.webm?t=1788357327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075080/extras/f8aa232b484dca48b6f6f02298a1045e.mp4?t=1788357327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles to unlock rooms or power up failed generators in the hotel. Why is it so complicated for power?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SECRETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep below the Hotel you could find  easter eggs or back story lore behind the secrets of the hotel. So search every corner and clean every room to see what you can find. Just be careful for any jump scares.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer: </strong>Purchase of this base game includes the first chapter. Further chapters will be coming soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Roach Hotel is an analog horror game set inside a once beloved hotel, a paradise for guest to come stay and relax. Step into its halls brought to life with a retro PS1 inspired aesthetic and unsettling VHS style visuals.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE HOTEL STORY:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Oxley Hotel, a resort that promises comfort to every guest. But behind its doors, the walls move when you’re not watching, and something stalks you in the shadows. Guided only by a note from your missing sister, you must uncover the truth, survive the lurking hallways, and escape the roaches crawling beneath the hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for your sister and uncover the  secrets buried beneath the Oxley Hotel. Discover what truly began this nightmare, but only if you step inside. Are you brave enough?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARRIVAL IN THE HOTEL:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE:</strong> Wander the  halls and uncover the unsettling secrets lurking within the hotel’s walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075080/extras/10c3ba65a2ae9463f7e07b5f81931556.poster.avif?t=1788357327\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075080/extras/10c3ba65a2ae9463f7e07b5f81931556.webm?t=1788357327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075080/extras/10c3ba65a2ae9463f7e07b5f81931556.mp4?t=1788357327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>