VITYPAL</strong>: Use this tool to move heavier objects to solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075080/extras/f8aa232b484dca48b6f6f02298a1045e.poster.avif?t=1788357327\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075080/extras/f8aa232b484dca48b6f6f02298a1045e.webm?t=1788357327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075080/extras/f8aa232b484dca48b6f6f02298a1045e.mp4?t=1788357327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles to unlock rooms or power up failed generators in the hotel. Why is it so complicated for power?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SECRETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep below the Hotel you could find  easter eggs or back story lore behind the secrets of the hotel. So search every corner and clean every room to see what you can find. Just be careful for any jump scares.</p>",
